OL,3,GNEWSAParents face extra bus fees over
OL,4,Asmartphone stance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of parents who have delayed
OL,7,Fgiving their children smartphones said
OL,8,Fthe move has forced them to pay an
OL,9,Fextra #585 per year in bus fares to
OL,10,Fschool.
OL,12,FOperator trentbarton reduces a child's
OL,13,Fsingle fare from #3 to #1.50 when they
OL,14,Fshow their b_line travel pass - which
OL,15,Fis only available via the mango
OL,16,Fsmartphone app.
OL,18,FParents who have said they want to
OL,19,Fprotect their children from issues
OL,20,Frelated to smartphones said they feel
OL,21,Fpenalised and have called for a
OL,22,Fnon-digital way to access the discount.
